# Check every text file out with LF, on every platform.
#
# Experience packs, registry items and product-validation artifacts are pinned
# by SHA-256 over their raw bytes. Without this, a Windows clone (core.autocrlf
# defaults to true) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, every one of those digests
# changes, and integrity verification fails — both in the test suite and at
# runtime in assertExperiencePackVerified().
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
